Turbo standalone kernel preview
Copyright 2025-present the zvec project

This distribution contains vector kernels and a floating-point type header
extracted and adapted from zvec under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Original copyright notices are retained. UPSTREAM.json records the exact
source revision and SHA-256 hashes before adaptation.

Standalone changes include namespace/include isolation, runtime availability
checks, OS-aware CPU detection, portable binary16 conversion, packaging,
tests, examples and documentation.

Highway is an architectural reference for packaging and runtime dispatch.
Highway source code is not included, and Highway is not a dependency.
Eigen, RaBitQ, the zvec database/index framework, and their third-party
dependencies are not included in this kernel-only distribution.
